<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= subject %></title>
  <style>
    body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
    img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100% !important;
      min-width: 100%;
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #2d3748;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      table-layout: fixed;
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      padding: 30px 10px;
    }
    .main-table {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .header-bar {
      height: 6px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6 0%, #6366f1 50%, #8b5cf6 100%);
    }
    .content-cell {
      padding: 36px 36px 28px 36px;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #1a202c;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 18px 0;
    }
    p {
      color: #4a5568;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    }
    .highlight-box {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .highlight-box p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .skills-container {
      margin: 16px 0 22px 0;
    }
    .skill-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #eff6ff;
      color: #1d4ed8;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin: 3px 4px 3px 0;
      border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
    }
    .button-table {
      margin: 24px 0 12px 0;
    }
    .cta-button {
      background-color: #2563eb;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 11px 22px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .secondary-link {
      color: #2563eb !important;
      text-decoration: underline;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-left: 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .signature-area {
      border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
      padding-top: 20px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }
    .sender-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e293b;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin: 0 0 2px 0;
    }
    .sender-role {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    }
    .sender-links a {
      color: #3b82f6;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-right: 12px;
    }
    .footer-cell {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 16px 36px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
    }
    .footer-cell p {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .content-cell { padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px !important; }
      .footer-cell { padding: 14px 20px !important; }
      .cta-button { display: block !important; text-align: center !important; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .secondary-link { display: block !important; text-align: center !important; margin-left: 0 !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <table role="presentation" class="wrapper" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" class="main-table" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">
          <tr>
            <td class="header-bar"></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="content-cell">
              <h2>
                <% if (companyName && companyName !== 'your team') { %>
                  Hi <%= companyName %> Talent Acquisition Team,
                <% } else { %>
                  Hi Hiring Team,
                <% } %>
              </h2>

              <p>
                I hope this email finds you well. I am reaching out to express my strong interest in software engineering and development opportunities at <strong><%= companyName || 'your esteemed organization' %></strong><% if (location) { %> (<%= location %>)<% } %>.
              </p>

              <p>
                With <strong><%= sender.yearsOfExp %></strong> of hands-on experience building scalable web applications and robust backend architectures, I have developed expertise in delivering high-quality, maintainable code and solving complex technical challenges.
              </p>

              <div class="highlight-box">
                <p><strong>Key Technical Highlights:</strong></p>
                <div class="skills-container">
                  <% if (sender.skills) { %>
                    <% sender.skills.split(',').forEach(function(skill) { %>
                      <span class="skill-tag"><%= skill.trim() %></span>
                    <% }); %>
                  <% } %>
                </div>
              </div>

              <p>
                I would welcome the opportunity to connect and discuss how my skills and problem-solving mindset can contribute to current or upcoming engineering openings in your team.
              </p>

              <!-- Call to Action -->
              <table role="presentation" class="button-table" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <% if (sender.portfolio) { %>
                      <a href="<%= sender.portfolio %>" class="cta-button" target="_blank">View Portfolio & Projects</a>
                    <% } %>
                    <% if (sender.linkedin) { %>
                      <a href="<%= sender.linkedin %>" class="secondary-link" target="_blank">LinkedIn Profile &rarr;</a>
                    <% } %>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Signature -->
              <div class="signature-area">
                <p class="sender-name"><%= sender.name %></p>
                <p class="sender-role"><%= sender.title %></p>
                <div class="sender-links">
                  <% if (sender.phone) { %>
                    <span>📞 <%= sender.phone %></span> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                  <% } %>
                  <% if (sender.email) { %>
                    <span>✉️ <%= sender.email %></span>
                  <% } %>
                  <% if (sender.github) { %>
                    &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="<%= sender.github %>" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
                  <% } %>
                </div>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="footer-cell">
              <p>
                You received this email because your contact was listed for talent outreach. If this was sent in error, please reply with "Unsubscribe" to be removed immediately.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
